  "description": "Invalid-click protection and ad-serving control for Umbraco sites monetized with Google AdSense (or any ad network). Decides per visitor whether ad code is served at all: blocks bots/scanners via IP/CIDR/country/ASN rules, counts ad-click intent per IP and per anonymous cookie, auto-cools down repeat clickers, and ships a backoffice dashboard (rules, active blocks, click log, live settings). Cache-safe by design (the Razor slot stays empty; a tiny fetch decides), CGNAT-aware, optional hashed-IP storage, works on Umbraco 17 and 18.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "uTPro.Feature.AdProtect",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-07T10:39:23.63Z",
