  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 126354,
  "projectUrl": "https://docs.utpro.dev/uTPro.Feature.AdProtect/",
  "published": "2026-11-07T10:36:11.58Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v17.0.0 / v18.0.0: Initial release. Ships as two version lines — 17.x for Umbraco 17 and 18.x for Umbraco 18 — with each line's Umbraco dependency boxed to that one major, so an Umbraco 17 host always resolves the 17.x line. Visitor gate (IP/CIDR/country/ASN rules + datacenter-ASN seed), click-intent tracker with HMAC-token binding and de-duplication, per-IP/per-cookie click budget with auto cool-down, cache-safe check endpoint, utc-ad TagHelper + vanilla JS, backoffice workspace under Settings (dashboard, rules, blocks, click log, live settings), optional HMAC-hashed IP storage. Requires uTPro.Feature.GeoLocation.",
